    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "If a Digi-Egg card is affected by an effect that places it at the bottom of the deck, it will be placed at the bottom of the Digi-Egg deck.",
        "question": "What happens to Digi-Egg cards in the trash when this card's [On Play][When Digivolving] effect activates?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, that’s correct.",
        "question": "Does \"if this effect returned level 7 white cards\" in this card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect mean that it will activate even if I return a card such as BT12-112 [Shoutmon X7: Superior Mode] that has 2 or more colors including white?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you don't.",
        "question": "Do I gain 6 memory if I use this card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect to return 2 level 7 white cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
